<\/li><li>Dedicated support team every step of the way!<\/li><\/ul>","button_link":"","button_text":""}},"accordion_Qt4mkw":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"accordion_title":"<p>Never Ordered From Pop On?<\/p>","video_link":"","content":"<p>Get Pop On Fangs with Impression Kit <a href=\"https:\/\/poponveneers.com\/products\/pop-on-fangs\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here<\/span><\/a><\/p>","page":"","display_html_content":false,"text":"","additional_content":"","button_link":"","button_text":""}},"accordion_Pw3qcf":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"accordion_title":"<p>Return Policy<\/p>","video_link":"","content":"<p>Special Edition Products (Such as <strong>Pop On Fangs<\/strong>) are not eligible for cancelations, returns or refunds. They are only eligible for 1 remake.<\/p>","page":"","display_html_content":false,"text":"","additional_content":"","button_link":"","button_text":""}},"accordion_W4tMxw":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"accordion_title":"<p>Disclaimer<\/p>","video_link":"","content":"<p><em>Please note that the Pop On Fangs you receive may vary slightly in size, shape, and positioning compared to the images shown. The final product is customized to fit your unique teeth and chosen style. As each set is handcrafted, variations in length and fit may occur depending on the natural position of your teeth.<\/em><\/p>","page":"","display_html_content":false,"text":"","additional_content":"","button_link":"","button_text":""}},"accordion_Jpcgnn":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"accordion_title":"<p>Product Details<\/p>","video_link":"","content":"<p><strong>DO I NEED TO MAKE NEW IMPRESSIONS FOR POP ON FANGS?<\/strong>Nope! Since you’ve already purchased Pop On Veneers, we have your digital impressions on file. That means we can design your Pop On VIP Fangs without needing a new impression kit.<\/p><p><strong>HOW ARE POP ON FANGS MADE?<\/strong>We’ll use the same digital impression of your smile that we already have. Each set of Pop On VIP Fangs is carefully crafted for the top arch only.<\/p><p><strong>CAN I CHANGE THE COLOR OR STYLE?<br\/><\/strong>Yes! Pop On VIP Fang come in multiple styles so you can pick the one that best fits your look.<\/p><p><strong>CAN I CANCEL OR RETURN MY ORDER?<br\/><\/strong>Because Pop On VIP Fangs are a seasonal, custom-made product, they are not eligible for cancellations, returns, or refunds.<\/p><p><strong>WHEN WILL MY POP ON VIP FANGS BE READY?<br\/><\/strong>As soon as you place your order, we’ll get started right away using your saved impressions.<\/p>","page":"","display_html_content":false,"text":"","additional_content":"","button_link":"","button_text":""}},"accordion_4pqhaE":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"accordion_title":"<p>Shipping Information<\/p>","video_link":"","content":"<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Lab Time:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><strong>Standard:<\/strong> 2 weeks in lab time after impression approval.<\/p><p><strong>Rush:<\/strong> 1 week in lab time after impression approval (available for non-financed orders) Select rush in shipping methods. Please note: the rush processing fee is per order, and does not apply to all future orders or remakes.<\/p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Shipping Time: <\/strong><\/span>Orders in the continental US are eligible for 2-Day shipping with UPS, in all directions! <\/p>","page":"","display_html_content":false,"text":"","additional_content":"","button_link":"","button_text":""}},"freebies_rAHLCH":{"type":"freebies","settings":{"title":"What's included FREE with every purchase?","image_one":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-07-17_at_12.49.26_AM.png","text_one":"3D Models of Your Teeth","image_two":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-07-17_at_12.49.35_AM.png","text_two":"Mirrored Case","image_three":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-07-17_at_12.49.41_AM.png","text_three":"6 Cleaning Tablets","image_four":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-07